<</if>>

<<run setup.completeTutorial(1)>>

:: stage3-tutorial1-g-messages-eng [nobr]

<<timed 1s>>
    <<append "#chatHistory">>
         <<voicenote "assets/sound/ping1.mp3" "3s" "stage3-tutorial1-g-transcript-eng">>
        <</append>>
    <</timed>>


<<timed 6s>>
    <<append "#chatInputWrapper">>
       <div class="btn-option-wrapper">
      <<button "Dream Team Menu">>
        <<goto $nextPassage>>
        <</button>>
        </div>
        <</append>>
    <</timed>>

:: stage3-tutorial1-g-messages-cym [nobr]
Lorem Ipsum Welsh

:: stage3-tutorial1-g-transcript-eng [nobr]
<p>Wonderful work Dream Team I’m sure. </p>

<p>I love stories - as I’m sure you have gathered - and so it is brilliant to know that you have created dream stories for the BFG to collect. </p>

<p>Imagine, one of these Night-Time Dreams could be blown into someone’s ear when they sleep and experience it themselves. I wonder if you have someone who you’d like your dream to be experienced by? </p>

<p>Right, as you have completed the Night-Time Dreams section you have the choice to move onto another section or submit to the BFG. Don’t worry if you can’t do anymore today. </p>

<p>Haste makes waste - as they used to say. So take your time. </p>

<p>Speak soon. </p>


